<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0"><B>About Axcelis</B></P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0"><FONT STYLE="font-size: 10pt">Axcelis (Nasdaq: ACLS), headquartered
in Beverly, Mass., has been providing innovative, high-productivity solutions for the semiconductor industry for over 45 years. Axcelis
is dedicated to developing enabling process applications through the design, manufacture and complete life cycle support of ion implantation
systems, one of the most critical and enabling steps in the IC manufacturing process. Learn more about Axcelis at </FONT>www.axcelis.com.</P>

